    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;8.01</strong> Useful antibodies and their specificity in the differential diagnosis of breast metastases</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Zsuzsanna Varga",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 456.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Immunohistochemistry</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Specificity in primary breast cancer</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Specificity in non-breast primaries</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>References</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>GATA3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate in urothelial neoplasms</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29340880; 28965624; 26768031; 25906123}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>NY-BR-1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in salivary gland tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29116378; 21846919; 16675566}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in prostate cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29408697}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>ER</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High (in luminal-type cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate-high in ovarian and gastric cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28965624}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>SOX10</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High (in triple-negative cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in melanomas, Schwannian tumours, and myoepithelial carcinomas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28843711; 25724000}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>GCDFP-15</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate-high</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in salivary gland tumours and apocrine tumours; low in lung cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29340880; 28965624; 26768031; 25906123}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Mammaglobin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate-high</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate in salivary gland tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29340880; 28965624; 26768031; 25906123; 21846919}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK7</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate-high</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in tubo-ovarian cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28965624}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK20</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in gastrointestinal cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18042689}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>PAX8</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in serous tubo-ovarian and endometrial cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{21846919; 25844549; 18724243}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>p53</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in serous tubo-ovarian, endometrial, and gastrointestinal cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18042689}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CA125</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in serous ovarian, biliary, and pancreatic cancers</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18042689}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Melan-A (MART1)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in melanomas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{23276173}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>TTF1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-absent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High in lung adenocarcinomas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{18042689}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 130.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>S100</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 96.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-intermediate</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.55pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"212\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-intermediate in melanomas and peripheral nerve sheath tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{23276173}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
