  {
    "pkattachmentId": 33648,
    "bookid": 32,
    "chapterId": 137,
    "fileId": 7681,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Lung adenocarcinoma metastatic to the Breast</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsies show malignant glands within the breast parenchyma.&nbsp; The malignant glands contain luminal mucin, and are lined by cuboidal to columnar cells with hyperchromatic nuclei.&nbsp; Immunohistochemistry showed strong TTF1 positivity in the malignant cells, confirming a metastasis from lung adenocarcinoma.</p>",
    "source": "<p>SGH Pathology</p>",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/7681.dzi",
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 33649,
    "bookid": 32,
    "chapterId": 137,
    "fileId": 7682,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Gastric adenocarcinoma metastatic to the breast:&nbsp;</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsies show malignant cells invading the breast stroma, in between and into breast lobules.&nbsp; The malignant cells have&nbsp;hyperchromatic nuclei that are sometimes eccentric, giving a signet ring-like appearance.&nbsp; Mitoses and cytoplasmic vacuoles are present.&nbsp; There was a past history of gastric adenocarcinoma, and immunohistochemical studies&nbsp;supported metastasis of gastric origin.</p>",
    "source": "<p>SGH Pathology</p>",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/7682.dzi",
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 33651,
    "bookid": 32,
    "chapterId": 137,
    "fileId": 7684,
    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Rhabdomyosarcoma metastatic to the breast</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsies of the breast in a patient with past history of nasal rhabdomyosarcoma show malignant tumour nests with hyperchromatic nuclei and high nuclear-cytoplasmic ratios.&nbsp; Immunohistochemical workup confirmed rhabdomyosarcoma.</p>",
    "source": "<p>SGH Pathology</p>",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/7684.dzi",
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 33652,
